play=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n<p>This represents a parabola that opens in the direction of the negative <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"148\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-axis.</p>\n</div></div>",
